            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitesimal+cohesion"} infinitesimal cohesion
            the points-to-pieces transform is an
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalence"} equivalence
